# GitHub push after every step

CarDoctor MVP+ must stay on GitHub. **Do not leave finished work only on the local machine.**

## Automatic push (preferred)

Project hooks in `.cursor/hooks.json` run `.cursor/hooks/auto-push.ps1` on:

- `afterFileEdit` (debounced)
- `stop` (agent finished)
- `subagentStop`

The script stages safe files, commits, and pushes to `origin`. Secrets stay excluded.

Agents should still push deliberately when a logical step finishes; the hook is the safety net.

## Manual fallback

If the hook did not fire: `git add` → commit → `git push`. Never force-push `main` unless the user asks. Never commit `GoogleService-Info.plist`, `.env*`, or keys.
